        203.76,
        532.52,
        247.55,
        55.34,
        247.55
      ],
      "text": "WHEREAS, a substantial number of trucks and goods carriers regularly\ntransit through Silvassa City from nearby industrial areas;"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        55.34,
        257.65,
        533.72,
        257.65,
        533.72,
        328.38,
        55.34,
        328.38
      ],
      "text": "AND WHEREAS, the movement of heavy vehicles within city limits\nduring the ongoing Ganpati Festival period may cause traffic congestion, pose\nsafety risks to pedestrians, and hinder emergency response services;"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        55.34,
        338.48,
        535.5,
        338.48,
        535.5,
        408.37,
        55.34,
        408.37
      ],
      "text": "AND WHEREAS, it is necessary to regulate the entry of heavy vehicles\ninto Silvassa City and nearby areas to ensure public safety, maintain smooth\ntraffic flow, and facilitate peaceful celebration of the Ganpati Festival;"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 12,
      "poly": [
        55.34,
        417.63,
        537.28,
        417.63,
        537.28,
        543.09,
        55.34,
        543.09
      ],
      "text": "THEREFORE, in view of above and in exercise of the power conferral\nunder Section 163 of the Bhartiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, I, Amit\nKumar, Sub-Divisional Magistrate, Dadra & Nagar Haveli hereby order that\nthe following roads shall remain closed for heavy vehicles entering and passing\nthrough Silvassa during the following time slots:"
    },
